  objectSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5176c752ec1b15e46a05a97310704b6c, type: 3}
  questDescription: Reaper Wilma here, and harvest is coming! My scythe must cut
    as sharp as possible, legendary, and be quite quick, no time to waste! I want
    the best fortune too, treasure in every sheaf. And just slightly less effort,
    my back!
  requirements:
  - type: 3
    tier: 3
  - type: 2
    tier: 2
  - type: 5
    tier: 3
  - type: 4
    tier: 1
  successText: A golden harvest in one day! Even the wheat bowed to me!
  partialText: The wheat is cut. The fortune can wait for next year.
  failureText: Now it cuts nothing and the crows are laughing at me! Shameful!
